*Baseline.* Git revision `836eec2` of `toronto-ndt`, including the subsequent individual-site SQLite storage and region, location-search, project, network and map MVVM changes and project task workflows. The document describes the implementation, not an intended architecture. Source references identify the authoritative code. In particular, no calibrated RF simulator, authentication service, server-side job queue or multi-user conflict resolution is implemented.

